<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>亡阳 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%A1%E9%98%B3/</link><description>Recent content in 亡阳 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 09:14:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%A1%E9%98%B3/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>亡阳</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-17-wangyang/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 09:09:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-17-wangyang/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“亡阳”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论汗出不止、阳气欲脱的危重症治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;亡阳之症，虽是阳亡，其实阴虚不能摄阳，以致阳气外越。治当急补其气以固脱，兼补阴血以配阳。气足阳旺，阴复汗收，不可徒用止汗或纯补阴血&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>敛治法：论亡阳 论下血 论吐血 论头汗 论手汗</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-24-lianzhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 17:57:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-24-lianzhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“敛治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;气、血、汗&lt;/strong&gt;等将要耗散时的收敛固脱法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;气将散而收敛之&lt;/strong&gt;，但不可一味酸收寒遏，当以&lt;strong&gt;补为敛&lt;/strong&gt;，使正气固而散者自归。</description></item></channel></rss>